Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:04.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kimbly!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:11.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take revenge for what you did to Greed-san and my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kimbly-san,\Nwhat are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be that unusual,\Nconsidering I {\i1}am{\i0} a State Alchemist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:24.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sold us out and returned to the military! You're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:28.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to let her kill me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:32.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:35.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:34.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:36.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(360,470)}Let go of me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should make for some fine fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:41.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kimbly-san, what are you doing to that man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.65,0:00:50.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am, first and foremost, a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:52.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no reason why I should\Nbear the blame of some hooligan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:57.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:12.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:17.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:22.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:28.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I was hoping to see a really exciting explosion...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:13.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But thanks to your interference...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:22.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't lay a finger\Non Martel-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:25.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By Martel, do you\Nmean this snake here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:27.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san is a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These guys are Chimeras.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They aren't even\Nfull-fledged life forms!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:35.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kind of like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get away from Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you\Nthe chance to transmute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:48.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:53.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.88,0:04:00.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that you'd be deliberately providing me with ingredients...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:26.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:41.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He, like his brother,\Nis under my jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:45.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you have any problems with him, you can file a written complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I'm going to blow up that suit of armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to the\Nfrontlines yourself, Führer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let Liore\Nbecome another Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless we bring an end to this quickly, with a minimum of casualties...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:05.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to take over\Nas acting Führer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You want {\i1}me{\i0} to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:10.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:22.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acting Führer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:27.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and sorry, but could you send something to my wife for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She gets lonely\Nall alone at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:34.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yet another city must fall...\Nfor those who seek\Nthe Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you've come this far, then you must know what my objective is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be thinking of doing something foolish,\Nlike creating a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:03.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I have to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:10.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four years ago, back in Central,\Ndid you see a Chimera that looked like a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sent it back to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What else would you\Nhave had me do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not the kind of thing\Nthat we should be deciding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you plan on wiping out Rose and the other people of this city
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:29.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with that same self-serving logic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know Rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:57.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?\NYou're an alchemist, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:04.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm an alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemy is comprised of\Nthe three steps of comprehension, decomposition, and reconstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:11.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You unconsciously read your\Nopponent's metallic composition
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and then adjust your own technique to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I've been replacing the metal of my Automail
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with other metals besides steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, rapidly swapping around the metal in my Automail
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:31.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is messing up its\Ndelicate adjustments,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to\Nput you down quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You dimwit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:49.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once you use the lives of this town's people\Nto make your Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it will then be {\i1}your{\i0} turn to have vengeance taken against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?\NI can also destroy living flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Homunculi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.75,0:08:07.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Call me Lust, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Gluttony!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand why we're telling you our names, right, Fullmetal Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:17.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you mean that today, we'll be saying good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:36.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:39.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't kill us off so casually, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like you did to Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:50.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here we were protecting you,\Nscarred man of Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.51,0:08:52.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am your enemy, am I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:56.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're going to create a Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then we will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:00.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't let the boy interfere, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is something you gave my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:17.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:18.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:24.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate you! I hate you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:35.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the story between\Nyou and that homunculus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:40.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose... and Lyra as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Please, listen to what\Nthat man has to say, Ed."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.69,0:09:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what Rose-san\Napparently wants to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rose, you can't talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:03.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep it as a good-luck charm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so that even when I'm gone, you won't forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back when Ishbal was still peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:16.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had an older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:21.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An intelligent brother, whom I was proud of\Nand whom was respected by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother had a beautiful girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:27.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She fell ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and soon after, she was called home to Ishbala.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, what are you searching for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:42.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Grand Art.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a hallowed endeavor that can bring all people back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:49.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what those people from Central recently tried to promulgate here—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what they called alchemy—isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say that\Nwithin the Grand Art,\Nthere is a technique that\Nbrings people back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:11:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...\NSo that's it. That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:23.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother defied the teachings of Ishbala in order to bring her back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He lost part of his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet, she still\Nhad not come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother was cast out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:36.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Grand Art was the greatest abomination in Ishbal, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, did my brother succeed after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.89,0:11:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That woman named Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know how\Nhomunculi are born?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:50.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People conduct human transmutation and fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The botched product that is born at that time is a homunculus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it, I heard about that from Dante-san as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:01.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said she once committed human transmutation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:03.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and had created a homunculus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:06.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That could have been Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they shouldn't be able to survive very long as they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone is gathering up \Nhomunculi like Lust and Envy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,giving them multiple lives, and controlling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then Lust is the one\Nmy brother created?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:25.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's just a monster that\Nhas the same appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust was affected by\Nthis good-luck charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Homunculi have a weakness when \Nit comes to the remains of the person
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who was the basis of their human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:49.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soon after my brother departed,\Nwe were invaded for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:55.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were angered by the\Nsudden attack and rose up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:13:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, a long conflict began.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:03.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've learned a way to create a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.97,0:13:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:09.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we were to possess its power,\Nwe could save Ishbal\Nfrom its crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:12.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the middle of the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:15.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nobody rebuked\Nmy brother for returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, just as my brother was about to complete the Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:22.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he suddenly renounced his research.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:28.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I now know the reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:32.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also heard the story,\Nfrom an outcast in Kishua.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It takes a large number\Nof human lives
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to create a Philosopher's Stone using the Grand Art as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It probably takes so many lives
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that it would mean the destruction of a whole town, or a whole people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless the frustration, malice,\Nand anger released at that time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,all blend together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a Philosopher's Stone\Ncannot be formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to save Ishbal, \Nwe needed a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, for that to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:05.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ishbal would have to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.83,0:14:14.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am the State Alchemist in charge of the extermination of this district.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No more, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:21.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have been driven from our land,\Nand we are fleeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:26.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just told to exterminate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:32.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am to stamp out every last one of you who has eyes and skin of a different color.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:35.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A light bulb just\Nwent off in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:49.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I'll blow up your body, a little bit at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First, I'll turn your skin\Ninto an explosive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:14:59.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoops...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:02.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next will be this arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, next will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.35,0:15:16.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That body of yours looks like a transmutation circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.23,0:15:19.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there were any alchemists in Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, we have these\Ntransmutation amplifiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel Grand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:00.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:03.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:14.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I commit the lives of our people\Nwithin my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.74,0:16:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, why did you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is power within that arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:27.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I had not done this,\Nyou would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:29.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother... Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have done something\Nthat cannot be forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... liked her, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:46.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am going on ahead... to see her, first...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your brother was trying to transmute \Na Philosopher's Stone inside his own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:09.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He took the lives of the dying Ishbalan people
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:12.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and entrusted them to you, together with his own arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone itself possesses power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:18.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's how I managed to hold on to my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:22.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That arm itself is an unfinished Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why it reacts\Nwith red stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:29.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will take even more lives\Nto complete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why you're setting Rose up \Nto be some charismatic leader
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:35.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and manipulating\Nthe people of Liore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.11,0:17:35.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:40.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar-san is not going to\Nsacrifice the people of Liore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra, what are you\Neven doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After Dante-san passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I searched for a place where\NI could make my alchemy useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:52.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then I learned\Nof Scar-san's plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just before the fighting begins,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:59.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the people are going to flee through an underground passageway\Nthat has been made\Nunder the old church.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:03.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, the soldiers who have been lured into the city will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:14.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means there will\Nstill be casualties!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, how is it\Nall right to kill soldi—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know what \Nthey've done in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did the military do to Rose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:40.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was taken into\Nthe military's custody,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:42.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and when she came home, she had lost her speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:48.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you still ask us to forgive the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a problem.\NI want to go pick up Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:05.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Havoc-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.91,0:19:09.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NDon't tell me there's an attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on,\Nbut I heard that the Führer has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:28.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It pleases me that the Führer himself would call for someone such as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is a matter of some secrecy that\NI would like you two to lend me a hand with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Col.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kimbly, I want you to take the lead of Tucker-kun's Chimeras and infiltrate the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see, so you want us to run wild \Nand provoke them into attacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:47.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same trick that we used in the fighting at Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But even if we don't\Ngo to all that trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will only act in order\Nto restore peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:57.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they're the ones who start it,\Nwe can say we're fighting for a just cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, there is still one\NState Alchemist in Liore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:04.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:07.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has probably been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.73,0:20:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Find his body for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.73,0:20:12.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That will make our cause\Neven more just.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:16.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I don't find his corpse,\NI will see to it that he becomes one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:19.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A shame that\Nwe had to lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.87,0:20:25.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:28.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you do the same thing you did to Ishbal, nor will I let you kill Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, you're going to withdraw those orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:32.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.22,0:20:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your swift movements\Nwill not work against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have the Mightiest Eye, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ed! Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:05.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:06.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.87,0:21:08.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, listen to me, and tell Ed, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.99,0:21:10.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever, just get inside me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:16.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Alphonse-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.24,0:21:45.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have executed the Chimera that appeared to be threatening you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.31,0:23:39.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 41: "Holy Mother"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear it—that voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:50.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That familiar voice, that was supposed to have been lost a long time ago...
